				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1143,
				1
			],
			"Message": "feat(Cocoon): Dispatch $provide calls for 6 new language provider types\n\nWire `$provideInlineCompletion`, `$provideInlineEdit`, `$provideMultiDocumentHighlight`, `$provideMappedEdits`, `$provideDocumentPasteEdit`, and `$provideDocumentDropEdit` into the InvokeLanguageProvider dispatch table in Handler.ts. These correspond to the 6 Mountain RPC registration methods added in the preceding commit (register_inline_completion_item_provider et al.), completing the round-trip.\n\nEach case extracts the VS Code–compatible argument sequence (Document, Position, context/aux data, Token) from the Args array and delegates to the corresponding `provide*` method on the Provider object per the VS Code ≥1.87 LanguageFeatures contract. Alternate casing with/without trailing \"Items\"/\"s\" is handled to tolerate naming drift between registration and invocation paths.\n\nExtends the number of handled $provide methods from the original 17 to 23, covering the latest LanguageFeatures.rs provider arms registered on the Mountain side.",
			"SHA": "dd4fcd88678cc9137e0119a1569d90e1e45a8d1f"
		}
